						<DESC TI="e59c9e54-b561-4231-a69a-8921545245de">
							<p>
      Units are used to augment the value with additional information like 
      &quot;m/s&quot; or &quot;liter&quot;. That is necessary for a correct interpretation of the 
      physical value for input and output processes. The AC UNIT Library shall 
      ensure a common usage of one single unit spec.
    </p>
						</DESC>
